     "message": "<ul><li><strong>Spacing scale:</strong> 4/8/12/16/24/32</li><li>Keep vertical rhythm consistent across sections and components.</li><li>Align columns and modules to a predictable grid; avoid ad-hoc offsets.</li></ul>"
